OL,3,GNEWSACommunity crowdfunder launched for
OL,4,Anew arts space
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team behind a community radio and
OL,7,FTV station have launched a crowdfunder
OL,8,Fto help reopen a historic Sheffield pub
OL,9,Fas a live arts and media venue.
OL,11,FSheffield Community Media, which runs
OL,12,Fthe Sheffield Live broadcaster, bought
OL,13,Fthe former Tap and Barrel pub on
OL,14,FCastlegate earlier this year with help
OL,15,Ffrom social investment lender The Key
OL,16,FFund.
OL,18,FNow the group is inviting the public to
OL,19,Fbecome community shareholders and
OL,20,Fco-owners in the development of the
OL,21,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
