OL,3,GNEWSACommunity crowdfunder launched for
OL,4,Anew arts space
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Buckley of Sheffield Community
OL,7,FMedia said: "We are now inviting people
OL,8,Fto help us realise the full potential
OL,9,Fof this building as a venue for live
OL,10,Fmusic, performing arts and media, owned
OL,11,Fby and run for the benefit of the
OL,12,Fcommunity."
